{"id":"f021d07f8d6a8afe","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-mice.md","title":"Mouse","display":"df-mice — Mouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mice","aliases":["58-df-mice"],"display":"df-mice — Mouse","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mice — Mouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0f1db95b853d761e\" href=\"?note=0f1db95b853d761e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse\">58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2c90c7f1f68c14\" href=\"?note=3e2c90c7f1f68c14\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse\">58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mouse}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mouse}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\theta,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p\\in V\">\\(M,\\theta,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p\\in V\\)</span> (premouse, iteration-length bound, premouse language, projectum and standard parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\\)</span> (four-place sound-premouse predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\)</span> (iterable-premouse predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Mouse}_S\\)</span> (mouse predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mice} \\vdash \\mathrm{Mouse}_S(M,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\land\\exists L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mice} \\vdash \\mathrm{Mouse}_S(M,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\land\\exists L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A mouse is an iterable fine-structural premouse; the premouse language required by the soundness predicate is now explicitly bound.</li>\n<li>In conventions using <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_\\omega\">\\(M_\\omega\\)</span>, the subscript refers to a canonical mouse with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> Woodin cardinals, not to “Woodin cardinals below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"0f1db95b853d761e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-iterable-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"3e2c90c7f1f68c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mouse}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\theta,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mice} \\vdash \\mathrm{Mouse}_S(M,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IterablePremouse}_S(M,\\theta)\\land\\exists L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)","display":true},{"tex":"M_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1347,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-843","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-mice.md|58-df-mice]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["0f1db95b853d761e","3e2c90c7f1f68c14"]}